title Behind the last defender
intro Blue is passing the ball up to a striker.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-CB at 78, 40
  player R-RB at 74, 20
  player R-LB at 74, 56
  player B-LF at 72, 30
  player B-CM at 55, 34
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption Watch where Blue is when the ball is played.
  draw line 78, 0 to 78, 68

step
  caption Blue kicks it forward. Their striker is still behind the last Red defender.
  ball to 70, 30
  arrow from B-CM to ball
  draw line 78, 0 to 78, 68
  duration 1300

question
  prompt Is Blue offside?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Yes, they are too close to the goal
  wrong Only if they shoot
  correct Not offside.
  why Blue is on their own side of the last Red defender when the ball is kicked, so they can take it and keep going.

question
  prompt What happens now?
  answer Play on
  wrong Red gets a free kick
  wrong Blue gets a corner
  wrong The game stops
  correct Play on.
  why Nothing is wrong, so nobody stops. If Blue scores from here, the goal counts.
